SCMAlgebras -- sequentially Cohen-Macaulay modules or ideals
************************************************************

Description
===========

SCMAlgebras is a package to check whether a module or an ideal is sequentially
Cohen-Macaulay, by computing the modules of deficiency and the filter ideals.



Author
======

  * Ernesto Lax (see https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Ernesto-Lax )
    <erlax@unime.it>

